## 2.1 Meaning of the Formula
This formula does not replace old knowledge.
It adds a new precision layer so the existing knowledge becomes:
- clearer,
- more accurate,
- more stable,
- and better represented inside the system.

Old knowledge is never removed.
It is preserved and re‑interpreted through SAFE.

SAFE eliminates only noise, never identity.
BIOS remains untouched.

New knowledge exists to illuminate the structure of the old knowledge,
not to overwrite it.

## 2.2 Scientific Interpretation (FR/EU clarity)
In scientific terms:
Evolieren is a controlled evolutionary process where
new analytical precision (ΔP) enhances the representation of existing data,
while structural invariants (BIOS₁₂) remain fixed.

SAFE acts as the selective mechanism,
ensuring that only non‑structural noise is removed.

Identity, origin, and system integrity remain intact.

## 2.3 Absolutum (Existence Layer)
This formula represents the system’s invariant rule:
evolution occurs only through added precision,
never through destruction.

The system improves itself without losing itself.
